WEBVTT

1
00:00:13,780 --> 00:00:14,740
It's mine

2
00:00:22,940 --> 00:00:24,300
I dare to steal my money too

3
00:00:25,480 --> 00:00:27,080
Xiaojianjia, let me test you

4
00:00:27,280 --> 00:00:28,920
Which one of them do you think has a greater influence?

5
00:00:29,200 --> 00:00:30,320
This person has at least three bottles

6
00:00:30,640 --> 00:00:32,320
He is extremely ruthless and specializes in picking out the harmful effects of drugs.

7
00:00:32,520 --> 00:00:35,240
He was kicked to death and was seriously injured and the beating lasted for so long.

8
00:00:35,240 --> 00:00:37,560
Take it off again when your breath is gone

9
00:00:37,760 --> 00:00:38,920
That young man is in danger

10
00:00:41,110 --> 00:00:42,990
Xiaojianjia, everything you said is right.

11
00:00:43,390 --> 00:00:46,150
But you overlooked the most important thing

12
00:00:46,310 --> 00:00:47,550
This guy hasn't made a move yet

13
00:00:47,550 --> 00:00:48,980
How do you know his strength?

14
00:00:49,260 --> 00:00:50,500
like a knife

15
00:00:51,060 --> 00:00:52,140
He hasn't finished cutting you yet

16
00:00:52,760 --> 00:00:54,160
How do you know he's not good?
